---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { BUSINESS, telHref } from '../data/site';
import { localBusinessSchema } from '../utils/schema';

const crumbs = [{ name: 'Home', href: '/' }, { name: 'Insurance', href: '/insurance/' }];
const faqs = [
  {
    q: 'Does Medi-Cal cover ABA therapy?',
    a: 'Medi-Cal covers Behavioral Health Treatment, including ABA, for members under 21 when it is medically necessary, according to the California Department of Health Care Services. A physician or psychologist determines medical necessity.',
    link: { href: '/blog/does-medi-cal-cover-aba-therapy/', label: 'Read our Medi-Cal guide' },
  },
  {
    q: 'What do I need before starting ABA with insurance?',
    a: 'Plans usually ask for a diagnosis or recommendation from a physician or psychologist, and prior authorization before therapy starts. Requirements vary, so we help you confirm what your plan needs.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Will I have out-of-pocket costs?',
    a: 'That depends on your plan’s deductible, copays or coinsurance. We will help you understand your benefits before services begin so there are no surprises.',
  },
  {
    q: 'My plan isn’t listed. Can I still call?',
    a: `Yes. Call ${BUSINESS.phone} and we will check whether we can work with your plan and explain your options.`,
  },
];
---
<PageLayout
  title="Insurance & Medi-Cal for ABA Therapy"
  description="Many plans, including Medi-Cal, cover ABA therapy for children with an autism diagnosis. Learn how coverage works and how our team helps with authorization."
  h1="Insurance & Medi-Cal for ABA Therapy"
  eyebrow="Coverage"
  lead="Many plans, including Medi-Cal, cover ABA therapy for children with an autism diagnosis. Our team will help you understand your coverage and start the authorization process."
  crumbs={crumbs}
  faqs={faqs}
  faqTitle="Insurance questions"
  schema={[localBusinessSchema()]}
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap article-layout" style="padding-block:0">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>How we help with coverage</h2>
        <p>Insurance can feel like the hardest part of getting started. You don’t have to figure it out alone. When you call us, we can:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Walk you through what your plan typically requires for ABA therapy</li>
          <li>Explain the documents you may need, such as a diagnosis report or referral</li>
          <li>Help start the authorization process</li>
          <li>Talk through any expected out-of-pocket costs before services begin</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Medi-Cal and ABA therapy</h2>
        <p>
          In California, Medi-Cal covers Behavioral Health Treatment (BHT), which includes Applied Behavior Analysis, for
          members under 21 when services are medically necessary. Only a physician or psychologist can determine that BHT is
          medically necessary. Members enrolled in a Medi-Cal managed care plan receive BHT through their health plan
          (<a href="https://www.dhcs.ca.gov/services/medi-cal/Pages/BehavioralHealthTreatment.aspx" target="_blank" rel="noopener">California Department of Health Care Services</a>).
          In Orange County, many Medi-Cal members are enrolled with <a href="https://www.caloptima.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CalOptima Health</a>.
        </p>
        <p>For a step-by-step explanation, read <a href="/blog/does-medi-cal-cover-aba-therapy/">Does Medi-Cal cover ABA therapy?</a></p>

        <h2>Private and employer insurance</h2>
        <p>
          Many commercial health plans also cover ABA therapy for autism, but benefits, requirements and costs differ from plan
          to plan. The quickest way to find out is to call the member services number on your insurance card, or call us and
          we’ll help you check.
        </p>

        <h2>Plans we work with</h2>
        <!-- TODO (business): replace this paragraph with the verified list of accepted plans. Do not list a plan until it is confirmed. -->
        <p>
          We work with Medi-Cal and a range of health plans. Because networks change, please call
          <a href={telHref}>{BUSINESS.phone}</a> to confirm whether we can work with your specific plan.
        </p>

        <h2>What to have ready when you call</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Your child’s insurance card (you can share details by phone — please don’t send ID numbers through our website form)</li>
          <li>Any diagnosis report or recommendation you already have</li>
          <li>Your child’s pediatrician’s name</li>
          <li>Questions or concerns you’d like to discuss</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="disclaimer">This page is general information, not insurance or legal advice. Coverage depends on your specific plan. Always confirm benefits with your health plan.</p>
      </div>
      <aside class="sidebar">
        <div class="card cta-card">
          <h2>Check your coverage</h2>
          <p>Call our team and we’ll help you understand your benefits.</p>
          <a class="btn btn--light" href={telHref}>Call {BUSINESS.phone}</a>
          <p style="text-align:center;margin-top:.75rem"><a href="/contact/">or request a callback</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h2>Helpful guides</h2>
          <ul class="mt-1" style="padding-left:1.1rem;display:grid;gap:.5rem">
            <li><a href="/blog/does-medi-cal-cover-aba-therapy/">Does Medi-Cal cover ABA therapy?</a></li>
            <li><a href="/blog/when-to-get-an-autism-evaluation/">When to get an autism evaluation</a></li>
            <li><a href="/blog/autism-support-orange-county-parents/">Autism support in Orange County</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
